@startuml
title C4 code - Repository intelligence - session fit
package "Prism MCP server" {
  class "mcp.callTool" as Mcp <<existing function>>
  class "evaluateRepositoryFit" as Evaluate <<function>>
  class "resolveSessionCapacity" as Resolve <<function>>
  class "CapacityRegistry" as Registry <<data contract>>
  class "ContextPlanEstimate" as Estimate <<input contract>>
  class "SessionCosts" as Costs <<input contract>>
  class "FitDecision" as Decision <<return value>>
}

Mcp --> Evaluate : evaluates a read-only fit request
Evaluate ..> Resolve : resolves exact supported capacity
Resolve ..> Registry : selects host, provider, model, and version
Evaluate ..> Estimate : reads lower and upper estimates
Evaluate ..> Costs : subtracts target-session costs
Evaluate ..> Decision : returns FIT, SPLIT, UNCERTAIN, or UNSUPPORTED

note right of Resolve
  Condition: no exact supported registry entry exists.
  Response: return UNSUPPORTED without a fit classification.
  Governing requirement: session-fit.md section 2.
end note

note right of Evaluate
  Condition: an estimate is incomplete or a cost is invalid.
  Response: return UNCERTAIN or reject invalid input.
  Governing requirement: session-fit.md section 3.
end note
@enduml
